<http://data.silknow.org/object/78bdb87b-74cd-3628-9a7f-c64441071814>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel; large wall panel of silk compound satin; ground, originally blue, now light neutral yellow; made of three widths of material (only one is complete) including be-ribboned poodles dancing on scrolls, vulcan at forge, sea horse and fountains, swags, trophies of war, cadueus, etc.; border sewed on all four sides of rinceau with serpents (top and bottom) and with heads of lions smoking pipes and caryatids on sides; in each corner, a lion's head; two horizontal seams near top of center; worn, tender, badly faded, stained, and a number of tears; nail holes in edges."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0aee1178-0637-3748-9c75-26fc741c1ddb> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel; large wall panel of silk compound satin; ground, originally blue, now light neutral yellow; made of three widths of material (only one is complete) including be-ribboned poodles dancing on scrolls, vulcan at forge, sea horse and fountains, swags, trophies of war, cadueus, etc.; border sewed on all four sides of rinceau with serpents (top and bottom) and with heads of lions smoking pipes and caryatids on sides; in each corner, a lion's head; two horizontal seams near top of center; worn, tender, badly faded, stained, and a number of tears; nail holes in edges."@en ;
